              recording, both builds; simulated boot; run from its menu in
              OverSpec. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      116586 frames of a played recording, both builds: every register
              with R and all game memory after each hook, 193737 figures and
              44974516 sprite pixels identical, pace within 0.004%

  Emulator    OverSpec: from the patch menu, Enhanced on, the title and play
              with scripted keys

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
